1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,600
D.Ai OS. A computer that speaks your language.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:11,800
Ask for what you want, in a sentence. Block USB storage. Lock the screen after five minutes. Diamond shows the plan, you approve, and anything can be undone.

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,500
Your AI runs here, on your computer. Nothing leaves it unless you say so.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,200
Describe an app, and D.Ai Forge writes it, tests it, and runs it in a sandbox.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:30,400
Safe by design: full-disk encryption, a firewall, sandboxed readers, and a security score you can read.

6
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:36,100
Hebrew, Arabic, Russian and more, right to left or left to right, from the very first screen.

7
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:41,300
Find files by what is inside them. Live captions for anything that plays.

8
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:46,500
Encrypted messages between your computers, with no account and no server.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:51,700
Beautiful, fast, and free. Open source, built on Debian.

10
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:56,900
D.Ai OS. Download it at rubinny.com.
